Name:Rules pilot 260 - A merged creature dies as three cards
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:You control Bloodchief Ascension with three quest counters, have Cast Down and Thought Scour in hand and {B}{U} in your mana pool. The opponent is at 6 life and controls Plated Wurm merged with two Huntmaster Ligers (Plated Wurm on top). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-61aef9d2e62bb4a8 | A merged permanent that dies is put into the graveyard as each of its cards (CR 729.3, 721.3), so "whenever a card is put into an opponent's graveyard" triggers once per card: killing the three-card merged creature drains 6, more than milling two cards
